
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Ditch the Fizz!</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f1ffe9;
            color: #23452b;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #52b84b;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 35px 15px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 42px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        nav {
            background-color: #267b36;
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #ffeb73;
        }

        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 45px 20px;
            background-color: #d9ffc9;
        }

        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 30px;
            color: #267b36;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #ffcc33;
            color: #23452b;
            padding: 13px 25px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        section {
            padding: 35px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .cards {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            width: 280px;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 10px #00000015;
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #29923a;
        }

        .emoji {
            font-size: 55px;
        }

        .facts {
            background-color: #d9ffc9;
        }

        /* SUGAR COMPARISON */

        .comparison {
            background-color: #f1ffe9;
        }

        .sugar-card {
            background-color: white;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 10px #00000015;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .sugar-card h3 {
            color: #267b36;
        }

        .sugar-bar {
            background-color: #dddddd;
            width: 100%;
            height: 28px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .sugar-fill {
            height: 100%;
            border-radius: 20px;
            text-align: right;
            color: white;
            padding-right: 10px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            line-height: 28px;
        }

        .cola {
            background-color: #e74c3c;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .orange {
            background-color: #f39c12;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .lime {
            background-color: #52b84b;
            width: 0%;
        }

        .coconut {
            background-color: #2c9bd1;
            width: 35%;
        }

        .comparison-note {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #555555;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #267b36;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header h1 {
                font-size: 32px;
            }

            nav a {
                display: inline-block;
                margin: 7px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>🍋 DITCH THE FIZZ! 🥥</h1>
        <p>Choose Healthy. Stay Hydrated. Feel Great!</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#alternatives">Healthy Drinks</a>
        <a href="#facts">Health Facts</a>
        <a href="#comparison">Sugar Comparison</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="hero" id="home">
        <h2>Say Goodbye to Too Much Soda!</h2>

        <p>
            Welcome to Ditch the Fizz! Our mission is to
            encourage primary and secondary school students
            to reduce sugary soft drinks and choose healthier
            beverages like fresh lime juice and coconut water.
        </p>

        <a href="#alternatives" class="button">
            Discover Healthy Drinks
        </a>
    </div>

    <section id="alternatives">
        <h2>🥤 Choose a Healthier Drink!</h2>

        <div class="cards">

            <div class="card">
                <div class="emoji">🍋</div>
                <h3>Fresh Lime Juice</h3>
                <p>
                    Lime juice contains vitamin C.
                    Enjoy freshly squeezed lime with
                    clean water and little or no added sugar.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="emoji">🥥</div>
                <h3>Coconut Water</h3>
                <p>
                    Natural coconut water contains
                    water and electrolytes such as potassium.
                    It can be a refreshing drink.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="emoji">💧</div>
                <h3>Plain Water</h3>
                <p>
                    Water helps your body stay hydrated.
                    It is a great everyday drink and
                    contains no added sugar.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="facts" id="facts">
        <h2>📚 Why Reduce Soft Drinks?</h2>

        <div class="cards">

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Added Sugar</h3>
                <p>
                    Many soft drinks contain large amounts
                    of added sugar.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Dental Health</h3>
                <p>
                    Sugary and acidic drinks can contribute
                    to tooth decay and damage tooth enamel.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Healthier Choices</h3>
                <p>
                    Choosing water and other unsweetened
                    drinks helps reduce added sugar intake.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SUGAR COMPARISON SECTION -->

    <section class="comparison" id="comparison">

        <h2>🥤 How Much Sugar Are You Drinking?</h2>

        <p>
            Many soft drinks contain added sugar.
            Let's compare them with healthier alternatives!
        </p>

        <div class="cards">

            <div class="card">
                <div class="emoji">🥤</div>
                <h3>Regular Cola</h3>
                <h2>35g</h2>
                <p>Approximate sugar in a 330ml can.</p>
                <p>About 9 teaspoons!</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="emoji">🍊</div>
                <h3>Orange Soda</h3>
                <h2>35g</h2>
                <p>Illustrative estimate for a 330ml serving.</p>
                <p>Check the product label!</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="emoji">🍋</div>
                <h3>Fresh Lime Water</h3>
                <h2>0g added sugar</h2>
                <p>When prepared without added sugar.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="emoji">🥥</div>
                <h3>Coconut Water</h3>
                <h2>Varies</h2>
                <p>Contains natural sugars. Check the nutrition label.</p>
            </div>

        </div>

        <h2>📊 Visual Sugar Comparison</h2>

        <div class="sugar-card">

            <h3>🥤 Regular Cola (330ml)</h3>

            <div class="sugar-bar">
                <div class="sugar-fill cola">35g</div>
            </div>

            <h3>🍊 Orange Soda (330ml)</h3>

            <div class="sugar-bar">
                <div class="sugar-fill orange">35g</div>
            </div>

            <h3>🍋 Fresh Lime Water (no added sugar)</h3>

            <div class="sugar-bar">
                <div class="sugar-fill lime"></div>
            </div>

            <p class="comparison-note">
                Natural coconut water has a varying amount
                of sugar, so check its nutrition label before
                comparing it with other drinks.
            </p>

        </div>

        <h2>💚 Make a Healthier Choice!</h2>

        <p>
            Choose plain water, fresh lime water with little
            or no added sugar, or unsweetened coconut water.
        </p>

    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>🌴 Make the Healthy Choice!</h2>

        <p>
            Small changes can make a big difference.
            Start choosing healthier drinks today!
        </p>

        <h2>🍋 + 🥥 = 💚</h2>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>Ditch the Fizz! | Promoting Healthier Drink Choices</p>
        <p>Made for Primary and Secondary School Students.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
